comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T08:56:50.560Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict-read 2738-item all-status snapshot and keyword AND search package internal tier discovery found completed general tiering pm-kxci8x and active builtin helper routing pm-szdc but no focused arbitrary-package runtime-contract omission owner. This residual has a distinct dynamic registration boundary and remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-12T09:22:42.310Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence: the mandatory defect gate rejected this newly recorded recurrence because its two-item lineage had no family seed. Register the completed surface-tier predecessor in declared-set-versus-hand-maintained-list: the reproduced failure consults a core-only identity list instead of the registered package contract. This selects existing static and smoke gates for both lineage members; registration does not claim the pending product fix is implemented."
  "2026-09-13T16:12:46.630Z","harness:codex","Verification: real temporary npm and Bun installations of the packed candidate passed package install; default flags, summary, schema and runtime discovery; full/scoped tier metadata; internal command invocation; native/legacy history acknowledgment previews; item create/comment/dependency/read journeys; npx and bunx execution. The package-visibility regression failed before the fix and now passes, including mixed public/internal aliases of one action. GitHub open issues all already carry canonical PM file links; live Dependabot, code-scanning and secret-scanning open-alert inventories were empty."
  "2026-09-13T17:15:17.158Z","harness:codex","Final local validation passed 8819 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage. Repository-wide static quality, linked regressions, typecheck, 57 token-surface budgets, Trivy, ShellCheck, secret scan and documentation links passed. Newly packed npm and Bun consumers passed real extension discovery/invocation, native/legacy author preview, item creation/comments/dependencies and npx/bunx acceptance. Implementation closure is prepared for the combined reviewed PR; this does not claim publication of these candidate changes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-13T16:33:05.010Z","harness:codex",Filter command visibility before merging extension aliases by action identity; otherwise a hidden spelling can leak through the merged action schema even when the command list is filtered.
